Package: TransferLearning
Title: Reproducible Patient-Level Transfer Learning Experiments
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Egill", "Fridgeirsson", email = "e.fridgeirsson@erasmusmc.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Runs paired learning-curve experiments across observational databases
    using PatientLevelPrediction and Cyclops. Stores source preprocessing, matches
    coefficients by semantic covariate identifiers, and performs fold-specific
    preprocessing and tuning for transfer and target-only models.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Andromeda, Cyclops, PatientLevelPrediction, FeatureExtraction,
    CohortGenerator, ParallelLogger,
    dplyr, digest, ggplot2, pROC, rlang, stats, utils
Suggests: DatabaseConnector, testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, roxygen2, covr, duckdb, DBI,
    PhenotypeLibrary, CirceR, jsonlite
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/mi-erasmusmc/transferLearning
BugReports: https://github.com/mi-erasmusmc/transferLearning/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
